    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a familiar yet subtly wrong version of modern day Shibuya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine morning commute quietly unravels. You awaken in your office after hours. Everyone is gone. The city lights outside feel distant, artificial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/136b16589f395181b22bc5474e7e4355.poster.avif?t=1753595169\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/136b16589f395181b22bc5474e7e4355.webm?t=1753595169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/136b16589f395181b22bc5474e7e4355.mp4?t=1753595169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the 32nd floor, you must descend through echoing corridors, sealed elevators, and rooms that seem to rearrange themselves when you're not looking. Along the way, you\u2019ll gather fragments of a forgotten device, each \u201cshard\u201d unlocking strange messages and impossible truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/b02d995f839ff12968dbd40cebce23b6.poster.avif?t=1753595169\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/b02d995f839ff12968dbd40cebce23b6.webm?t=1753595169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/b02d995f839ff12968dbd40cebce23b6.mp4?t=1753595169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you navigating a glitch in space\u2026 or your own fractured memory?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal, hyper-realistic reimagining of Shibuya\u2019s corporate interiors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate from floor 32 to the street through immersive, detail-rich spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover shard fragments to decode a hidden AI language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric puzzles and spatial storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ambient soundscape that blurs the line between simulation and reality</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into a familiar yet subtly wrong version of modern day Shibuya.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What begins as a routine morning commute quietly unravels. You awaken in your office after hours. Everyone is gone. The city lights outside feel distant, artificial.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/136b16589f395181b22bc5474e7e4355.poster.avif?t=1753595169\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/136b16589f395181b22bc5474e7e4355.webm?t=1753595169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/136b16589f395181b22bc5474e7e4355.mp4?t=1753595169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From the 32nd floor, you must descend through echoing corridors, sealed elevators, and rooms that seem to rearrange themselves when you're not looking. Along the way, you\u2019ll gather fragments of a forgotten device, each \u201cshard\u201d unlocking strange messages and impossible truths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/b02d995f839ff12968dbd40cebce23b6.poster.avif?t=1753595169\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/b02d995f839ff12968dbd40cebce23b6.webm?t=1753595169\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3805820/extras/b02d995f839ff12968dbd40cebce23b6.mp4?t=1753595169\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you navigating a glitch in space\u2026 or your own fractured memory?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udd39 <strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A surreal, hyper-realistic reimagining of Shibuya\u2019s corporate interiors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate from floor 32 to the street through immersive, detail-rich spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover shard fragments to decode a hidden AI language</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atmospheric puzzles and spatial storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ambient soundscape that blurs the line between simulation and reality</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Backrooms style thriller set in a deserted Shibuya skyscraper. Awaken on the 32nd floor at midnight, collect shards, unlock secrets, and escape before you disappear forever.",
